{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本北部青森縣，有外國遊客被熊咬傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">事發在青森縣一個可眺望十和田湖的展望台附近，當地今早10時左右，一名年約30歲外國男遊客，散步時被熊咬傷右臂。他事後由直升機送院，意識清醒並可以正常說話。暫未知熊的大小及數量，當局已委託獵友會放置陷阱捕捉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026FLJUU6j27Z1787406491.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.BEAR-2300.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T14:19:50.434927+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}